OL,4,G1930FJo Whiley
OL,5,     GJo handpicks her favourite new
OL,6,     Gmusic from all genres of the
OL,7,     Gmusical spectrum and quality
OL,8,     Gvintage songs too.
OL,9,G2100FThe Blues Show with Cerys Matthews
OL,10,     GJames Hunter joins Cerys to play
OL,11,     Gsome of his favourite blues
OL,12,     Grecords and tells us about The
OL,13,     GJames Hunter Six's new album Off
OL,14,     GThe Fence.
OL,15,G2200FThe Good Groove with DJ Spoony
OL,16,     GFeel-good tunes to make you
OL,17,     Ggroove. 'Dr. Beat' is also on
OL,18,     Ghand to prescribe a perfect tune
OL,19,     Gfor a listener whose week hasn't
OL,20,     Ggot off to the best start!
